- $f_i$: `fixed_opening_cost` column in table_id `file_1_view_0`, indexed by `facility_id`
- $c_{ij}$: `transportation_cost_to_*` columns in table_id `file_2_view_0`, indexed by `facility_id` (rows) and customer suffix (columns)
- $D_j$: $d_j$ as above

